[{:db/id -1, :doc/id "docs-claude-etzhayyim-root", :doc/title "etzhayyim/root docs — Documentation System Rules", :doc/status "active", :doc/doc_type "reference", :doc/source-format "edn", :doc/body "\n# etzhayyim/root docs — Documentation System Rules\n\n`90-docs/` は **human-readable Markdown** を canonical source とし、機械可読な索引は sidecar registry に分離する。\n\n## Goal\n\n- 人間に読みやすい本文を維持する\n- LLM が authoritative doc を短距離で見つけられるようにする\n- Shannon redundancy を抑え、設計判断の重複と drift を減らす\n\n## Canonical Structure\n\n- 本文: `**/*.md` (repo-wide)\n- decision record: `90-docs/adr/*.md`\n- machine registry: `90-docs/_registry/docs.json` (generated by `70-tools/scripts/docs/regen-registry.clj`, babashka — run `bb 70-tools/scripts/docs/regen-registry.clj`)\n- machine registry (EDN): `90-docs/_registry/docs.edn` — same data for babashka / Clojure consumers (kebab-case keyword keys, `*.adr.edn` convention); read with `(clojure.edn/read-string (slurp \"90-docs/_registry/docs.edn\"))`. Emitted in lock-step with `docs.json` from the same generator; the `docs-registry-freshness` gate (`--check`) verifies both.\n- relation graph: `90-docs/_registry/graph.edn` (EDN; typed relation-graph projection of `docs.edn`, generated by `70-tools/scripts/docs/regen-graph-edn.clj` — run `bb 70-tools/scripts/docs/regen-graph-edn.clj`; the `docs-graph-edn-freshness` gate verifies `--check`). Successor to the retired `graph.jsonld` (JSON-LD), per the \"use EDN, not JSON-LD\" directive. Chain: `.md → docs.edn → graph.edn`.\n- schemas: `90-docs/_registry/schemas/*.schema.json` (docs.json / kotodama / hayate)\n\n**CRITICAL**:\n\n- Markdown 本文が canonical source。`90-docs/` 配下に限らず repo 全体の `.md` が対象\n- EDN sidecar (`docs.edn` / `graph.edn`) は本文の代替ではなく relation/index sidecar\n- 「同じ判断」を複数 doc に複写しない。正本 1 つを registry で指す\n\n## ADR Placement Policy (THIS REPO IS CANONICAL FOR OPEN-SCOPE)\n\nPer ADR-2605170900: **new open-scope ADRs go in `etzhayyim/root/90-docs/adr/`** (this directory).\n\nScope of \"open religious-corp activities\" covered here: blockchain / baien / bpmn / lexicon / pregel / atproto / ameno / open-data / public governance — new designs, new features, new app architectures, new bonsai metaphor extensions.\n\n## Required Metadata For New Or Materially Updated Docs\n\n新規 doc、または意味論が変わる更新を行う doc は、冒頭に YAML front matter を置く。\n\n必須キー:\n\n- `id`\n- `title`\n- `status` — `active` / `proposed` / `deprecated` / `superseded`\n- `doc_type` — `explanation` / `reference` / `how-to` / `tutorial` / `adr`\n- `topic`\n- `authoritative` — `true` / `false`\n- `last_verified`\n\n推奨キー:\n\n- `authoritative_for`\n- `related` (URLs ok for cross-repo references)\n- `supersedes`\n- `superseded_by`\n- `depends_on` (for ADRs)\n\n## Authoritative Doc Rule\n\n各 topic には authoritative doc を最大 1 つ置く。\n\n- 深掘り比較、調査メモ、履歴保全は `authoritative: false`\n- repo の現行判断を定める doc は `authoritative: true`\n- 新しい判断で古い doc を置き換えたら `supersedes` / `superseded_by` を更新する\n\n## ADR ID Convention\n\nADR ファイル名: `YYMMDDhhmm-<topic-slug>.md`\n\n- `YYMMDDhhmm` = JST 作成時刻 (5-digit short year + month + day + 24h hour + minute)\n- `<topic-slug>` = kebab-case 短い topic 名\n- 例: `2605170900-etzhayyim-root-adr-canonical-home.md` (2026-05-17 09:00 JST)\n\netzhayyim/root の ADR ID は 2605170000 系から開始。\n\n## Section Order (for design/eval ADRs)\n\n1. `Context`\n2. `Decision`\n3. `Consequences`\n4. `Alternatives Considered`\n5. `References`\n\n## Cross-Repo Reference\n\n外部 ADR を参照する場合は ID と短いタイトルのみ記載し、URL は内部経路で参照する:\n\n```markdown\n- ADR-2604251830 (Shannon-Optimal 8-Layer Architecture)\n```\n\n## Tranche F Closure Dossier (2026-05-21)\n\nADR-2605152100 6-phase org-split cutover の Phase 3-6 governance + runbook が\n2026-05-21 セッションで全 landed。新しい operator / agent は **`90-docs/TRANCHE-F-INDEX.edn`**\nを入口にして該当 doc に navigate する。\n\n- `TRANCHE-F-INDEX.md` — operator navigation hub (どの doc を読むか早見表)\n- `2605211800-vendor-importer-survey-gate-d.md` — gate (d) 4 target files\n- `2605211900-tranche-f-all-gates-closure-confirmation.md` — gate status snapshot (honest framing)\n- `2605211949-gate-a-execution-checklist.md` — **42-row operator checkbox** for per-worker port\n- `2605212020-session-post-mortem-2026-05-21.md` — session narrative + revert pattern explanation\n- `adr/2605211757-...dns-cutover-runbook...md` — gate (b) + (c) inline (Wave A-D)\n- `adr/2605211913-...phase-4-5-runbook.md` — vendor refactor + git rm\n- `adr/2605211925-phase-6-archive-markers-runbook.md` — MOVED stubs + GitHub archive\n\nGate (a) per-worker re-impl は execution OPEN — 42 checkbox を tick することで\nDNS cutover → Phase 5 git rm → Phase 6 archive markers が unblock する。\n", :doc/path "90-docs/CLAUDE.edn", :doc/source-repo "root", :doc/topic "docs-system-rules", :doc/last_verified "2026-05-17", :doc/date "2026-05-17", :doc/authoritative true, :doc/authoritative_for ["etzhayyim/root docs system rules and metadata policy" "ADR placement policy (open-scope)"]}]
